  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Promoting Local Development in Cabo Verde</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project strengthens local development in Cabo Verde by addressing gaps in social and financial service delivery and leveraging local and regional potential. It focuses on three key outcomes:1. Increased local revenue to support development agendas;2. Enhanced capacity of local and national actors to improve development outcomes and impact;3. Reinforced local development through improved planning and targeted projects across all 22 municipalities.</narrative>
  </description>
